These days, one can get by without math for a long time.
But it is not the case when you are in deep space.
Orbital insertions, gravity assist, station keeping, docking procedures, attitude control...

Precise math is the foundation of space flight.

That is why DUSTY-12 has a solid core of arithmetic operands capable of performing additions, subtractions, multiplications, among other things.

The ground control wants to evaluate DUSTY-12 arithmetic functions.

Select a pair of numbers, place them on the data stack, and perform the ADD operation on them.

Then select another pair and perform a subtraction (SUB).

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
05
06
ADD
08
SUB

